#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/insurgo-privacybeast-x230.rst:10
#: 9a0909c9701c4d309155e9fac1dc06be
msgid ""
"**Warning:** The CPU in this computer no longer receives microcode updates "
"from Intel. Without microcode updates, Qubes OS cannot ensure that this "
"computer is secure against CPU vulnerabilities. While this computer remains "
"certified for Qubes OS Release 4, we recommend that prospective buyers "
"consider a newer Qubes-certified computer instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/insurgo-privacybeast-x230.rst:12
#: c5253697865044188b594720abe53d3a
msgid ""
"The `Insurgo PrivacyBeast X230 <https://insurgo.ca/produit/qubesos-certified-"
"privacybeast_x230-reasonably-secured-laptop/>`__ is :doc:`officially "
"certified </user/hardware/certified-hardware/certified-hardware>` for Qubes "
"OS Release 4."
msgstr ""

